moved?\",\"Related resources\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Set up email and calendar sync for relationship insights.\",\"title\":\"Sync your email and calendar\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"6b37818c-8a76-45ba-b4b7-26490e44e4c4\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"Email and calendar sync connects your inbox and calendar to …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$80\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Sync your email and calendar\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Attio 101\",\"Attio's data model\",\"Understanding Attio's data model\"],\"content\":\"$81\",\"dislikes\":7,\"href\":\"/help/reference/attio-101/attios-data-model/understanding-attio-data-model\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/18x18/af4ae803c6/workspace-arrow.svg\",\"likes\":11,\"name\":\"Understanding Attio's data model\",\"subHeadings\":[\"Objects\",\"Attributes\",\"Records\",\"Lists\",\"Up next\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Key concepts for understanding how data works in Attio.\",\"title\":\"Understanding Attio's data model\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"6c5c5def-8d46-4d33-bba8-87a0740f0a0c\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"To start using Attio, you only need to understand a …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$82\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Understanding Attio's data model\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Attio 101\",\"Introduction to navigating Attio\"],\"content\":\"$83\",\"dislikes\":8,\"href\":\"/help/reference/attio-101/introduction-to-navigating-attio\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/18x18/af4ae803c6/workspace-arrow.svg\",\"likes\":10,\"name\":\"Introduction to navigating Attio\",\"subHeadings\":[\"Sidebar\",\"Main panel\",\"Learn more\",\"Up next\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Get to know your way around Attio.\",\"title\":\"Introduction to navigating Attio\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"c0b17f87-cb43-4e1d-b2a6-051ec4611ea7\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"The Attio workspace can be divided into two main areas …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$84\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Introduction to navigating Attio\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Imports \u0026 exports\",\"Migrate data from another CRM\"],\"content\":\"$85\",\"dislikes\":10,\"href\":\"/help/reference/imports-exports/migrate-data-from-another-crm\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/18x18/4f99ab41c2/change.svg\",\"likes\":9,\"name\":\"Migrate data from another CRM\",\"subHeadings\":[\"Import2 supported CRMs\",\"Source-specific guidance\",\"Migrating from Salesforce\",\"Migrating from Affinity\",\"Migrating from Attio\",\"Prepare for migration\",\"Prepare for updating attributes\",\"Enable objects\",\"Check formatting\",\"Begin migration\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Learn how to migrate your data from other CRMs.\",\"title\":\"Migrate data from another CRM\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"4bf05087-11fe-4cfc-95d8-807c1e4c730a\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"Import companies, people, deals, custom objects, notes, tasks, and files …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$86\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Migrate data from another CRM\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Automations\",\"Workflows\",\"Overview of workflows\"],\"content\":\"$87\",\"dislikes\":8,\"href\":\"/help/reference/automations/workflows/overview-of-workflows\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/18x18/dff7d7a818/workflows.svg\",\"likes\":8,\"name\":\"Overview of workflows\",\"subHeadings\":[\"How a workflow is structured\",\"What you can build\",\"Learn more about workflows\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Understand what workflows are and how they're structured.\",\"title\":\"Overview of workflows\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"b95687c6-df01-4305-93a2-96a08b9b3913\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"A workflow is a set of automated rules that runs …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$88\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Overview of workflows\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Support\",\"Priority Support\"],\"content\":\"Customers on Attio’s Pro and Enterprise plans receive Priority Support. Learn more about plans and pricing. \\nSupport office hours \\nAttio’s Customer Support office hours are from 12am to 6pm PST, Monday through Friday, except on public holidays. Inquiries made outside these hours will receive a response on the next working day within office hours. \\nResponse times and prioritization \\nAttio’s Customer Support team's initial response times are typically under 1 hour during office hours, though this can vary based on the type and urgency of the inquiry. Pro and Enterprise customers’ inquiries are prioritized to receive a response more quickly than other inquiries. Issues reported by Pro and Enterprise customers will also be prioritized for quicker resolution times.\",\"dislikes\":12,\"href\":\"/help/reference/support/priority-support\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/18x18/2b1eba543d/comment.svg\",\"likes\":8,\"name\":\"Priority support\",\"subHeadings\":[\"Support office hours\",\"Response times and prioritization\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Attio offers Priority Support to Pro and Enterprise customers.\",\"title\":\"Priority Support\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"82f63653-e21b-435f-8ae0-105c254e9a59\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"Customers on Attio’s Pro and Enterprise plans receive Priority …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"Customers on Attio’s Pro and Enterprise plans receive Priority Support. Learn more about plans and pricing. \\nSupport office hours \\nAttio’s Customer Support office hours are from 12am to 6pm PST, Monday through Friday, except on public holidays. Inquiries made outside these hours will receive a response on the next working day within office hours. \\nResponse times and prioritization \\nAttio’s Customer Support team's initial response times are typically under 1 hour during office hours, though this can vary based on the type and urgency of the inquiry. Pro and Enterprise customers’ inquiries are prioritized to receive a response more quickly than other inquiries. Issues reported by Pro and Enterprise customers will also be prioritized for quicker resolution times.\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Priority Support\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Managing your data\",\"Objects\",\"Manage standard objects\"],\"content\":\"$89\",\"dislikes\":18,\"href\":\"/help/reference/managing-your-data/objects/manage-standard-objects\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/20x20/cedadb285b/object.svg\",\"likes\":8,\"name\":\"Manage standard objects\",\"subHeadings\":[\"What are standard objects?\",\"Companies and People standard objects\",\"Companies system attributes\",\"People system attributes\",\"Deals standard object\",\"Deals system attributes\",\"Users standard object\",\"Users system attributes\",\"Suggested custom attributes for Users\",\"Workspaces standard object\",\"Workspaces system attributes\",\"Suggested custom attributes for Workspaces\",\"Enable a standard object\",\"Deactivate a standard object\",\"Manage object attributes\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Learn about Attio's standard objects and how to manage them.\",\"title\":\"Manage standard objects\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"24983dfe-b953-4f2c-8f0a-ae3fe8b29c31\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"What are standard objects? \\nStandard objects are built-in …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$8a\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Manage standard objects\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Workspace settings \u0026 billing\",\"Manage workspace and seat credits\"],\"content\":\"$8b\",\"dislikes\":4,\"href\":\"/help/reference/workspace-settings-billing/manage-workspace-and-seat-credits\",\"icon\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/20x20/0c623717b2/workflow-credit.svg\",\"likes\":7,\"name\":\"Manage workspace and seat credits\",\"subHeadings\":[\"Credit types\",\"Credits included in each plan\",\"Workspace credits by plan\",\"Seat credits by plan\",\"When do credits renew?\",\"Manage workspace credits\",\"View workspace credit usage\",\"Purchase or remove additional workspace credits\",\"Manage seat credits and Ask Attio usage\",\"View Ask Attio usage (admins)\",\"View your seat credit usage (members)\",\"How features consume credits\",\"Ask Attio credit usage\",\"Workflow automations credit usage\",\"AI attributes credit usage\"],\"subType\":\"article\",\"summary\":\"Learn how credits are consumed and billed.\",\"title\":\"Manage workspace and seat credits\",\"type\":\"help\",\"objectID\":\"ebbb098d-f12a-45d3-9d3a-0655a85db9ff\",\"_snippetResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"Attio uses credits to measure resource consumption for AI features …\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\"}},\"_highlightResult\":{\"content\":{\"value\":\"$8c\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"title\":{\"value\":\"Manage workspace and seat credits\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]}}},{\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Reference\",\"Workspace settings \u0026 billing\",\"Billing and payments\"],\"content\":\"$8d\",\"dislikes\"